                        "review": "This game is really fun. It has difficulty settings that you can tailor to your liking. There are many different buildings in the game, with most unlocking as you play and meet some requirement or other. If you play on easy it is a pretty relaxing fun time. I got it on sale and it is more than worth what I paid, and I have not unlocked even a quarter of my buildings yet, or explored at all outside the spot I started my settlement. \n\nAlso, I love the little horses.",
